<title>UK: BANQUE PARIBAS ADDS $250 MLN TO 5-YEAR FRN.</title>
<headline>BANQUE PARIBAS ADDS $250 MLN TO 5-YEAR FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased to $1.25 billion from $1.0 billion, lead manager Paribas Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE PARIBAS</p>
<p> AMT  $1.25 BLN	 BASE     **3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **1/8 PCT   PAY DATE    29.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.979    FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    99.979</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	NOT 144A</p>
<p>	    **INITIAL COUPON INTERPOLATED ONE AND TWO MONTH LIBOR</p>
<p>		PLUS 1/8.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
